  "title": "Liar Satsuki Can See Death",
  "description": "*\"You... are going to die tomorrow.\"* \n\nSatsuki Minazuki, 16 years old. Apart from being antisocial and declaring the death of her classmates, she is a normal second-year high school student. Her nickname is \"Liar Satsuki.\" However, her eyes alone are abnormal. What she is gazing at is... \n\n(Source: Shogakukan, translated) \n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*\n\nStatus: completed\nTags: 21st century, Bullied Protagonist, Crimes, Horror, Japan, Male Demographic with Female Lead, Mystery, Philosophy, Primarily Female Cast, Psychological, School Life, Seeing Things Other Humans Can't, Shoujo Ai, Shounen, Supernatural, Twisted Character, Bully, Bullying, Depression, Detectives, Drama, Dumb Female Lead, Female Lead, Female Protagonist, Girls Love Subtext, High School, Misunderstood Female Lead, Obsessive Love, Precognition, Premonition, School, Super Powers, Web Comic, Yuri, School Clubs",
